# sabotage=PassesDropCalls behind a pass over the whole program, in selected code: a call of an unknown function is gone. The pass puts the head of a known function in place of a call of it, and answers for that call alone: the build stops
# FORM: Selected
# RUN: pass InlineHeads
# DIAGNOSTIC: VerificationFailedAfterPass 1
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass sabotage=PassesDropCalls
# PROGRAM-OF: passes-drop-calls-in-selected-code-left-alone.ir
